{"prototypeToken":{"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"height":1,"width":1,"name":"Guiltbound","actorLink":false,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/tokens/guiltbound.webp","scaleX":2,"scaleY":2,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"negative":false,"priority":0},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":2,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/subjects/guiltbound.webp"}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"depth":1},"name":"Guiltbound","type":"npc","effects":[],"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":275,"temp":0,"max":275,"details":"negative healing"},"ac":{"value":27,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":20,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"death-effects","exceptions":[]},{"type":"disease","exceptions":[]},{"type":"fear-effects","exceptions":[]},{"type":"paralyzed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"poison","exceptions":[]},{"type":"unconscious","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"vitality","value":5,"exceptions":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["common","necril"],"details":""},"level":{"value":10},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>When a murderer shares a grave with their victim and the murder weapon (whether interred in a mass grave, buried at sea, or through sheer coincidence), the profane energies of the massacre fuse the three together, causing them to rise from the grave as a hideous amalgam. Bound together, the murderer is eternally presented with a grisly reminder of the deed they committed in life: the victim's corpse, likewise reanimated and perpetually gripped by fear, dangles from the murderer in place of one of its arms.</p>\n<p>A guiltbound is unable to venture far from its burial site and can often be found lingering near its grave. Paradoxically, their horrific appearance contradicts their behavior, as they tend to ignore those who have never committed murder and usually don't pose an immediate danger to those who have lived a peaceful life. Most give them a wide berth regardless. Moreover, some communities have used guiltbound as a way of determining guilt: if a guiltbound can see a suspected murderer, they are likely the perpetrator. In such cases, the guiltbound often also conveniently fulfill the role of executioner.</p>\n<h2>Grisly Sentry</h2>\n<p>A guiltbound can often unintentionally act as a guard for small communities, remaining unaware of innocent denizens while unerringly pursuing interlopers with a history of killing. A guiltbound possesses no nuance about who it sees as a murderer; justifications of self-defense will prove to be no defense at all.</p>\n<h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 125/275/500 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning), armor (light), perception item, skill items (Athletics, Intimidation)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> chaotic, charisma, elongating, energy resistant (negative), evil, negative, strength, wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Strange and Unusual","authors":"Kalen H.M.","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":7},"dex":{"mod":0},"con":{"mod":5},"int":{"mod":3},"wis":{"mod":3},"cha":{"mod":6}},"perception":{"details":"murdersense","mod":17,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":23,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":16,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":18,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"athletics":{"base":22},"intimidation":{"base":22}},"traits":{"value":["chaotic","evil","undead","unholy"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"med"}}},"img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/Portraits/guiltbound.webp","items":[{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Darkvision","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Darkvision]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"darkvision","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688328514457,"modifiedTime":1688328514457,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.qCCLZhnp2HhP3Ex6","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"IaXGLaCZwRYas9QN"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Murder Weapon","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The guiltbound is linked to their murder weapon, either a specific type of weapon (hatchet, for example) tied to the murder that created them, or one determined randomly. The guiltbound wields a spectral version of this weapon, with its murder weapon Strikes gaining the weapon's damage and traits, using a damage die one size higher for a simple weapon (the listed damage is for a longsword). A guiltbound also possesses weakness 10 to that specific type of weapon.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"9OXBD3VbUm6osbnF","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688328560452,"modifiedTime":1688328595091,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Murdersense","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A guiltbound can only sense creatures that have damaged it within the last 24 hours, or those who have killed another living, sapient being (not animals or mindless creatures) with any of its senses. Other creatures are thus @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Invisible]{Invisible}, inaudible, and otherwise undetectable to a guiltbound.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"9j4Scxn1NkLjJyQW","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688328596228,"modifiedTime":1688328629211,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Negative Healing","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"},"rules":[{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"override","path":"system.attributes.hp.negativeHealing","value":true}],"slug":"negative-healing","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary 2","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688328655476,"modifiedTime":1688328655476,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.TTCw5NusiSSkJU1x","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"ndYqODnVJ6GmNPZ8"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Mounting Terror","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A creature struck by the guiltbound begins to experience the moments that led up to the murder, eventually reliving the heart- stopping instant before the victim's death. They must attempt a @Check[type:will|dc:23] save, and they take a –2 circumstance penalty to their save if they've damaged the guiltbound in the last round.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Frightened]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Frightened]{Frightened 2} and takes @Damage[1d8[void]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Frightened]{Frightened 3}, @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Doomed]{Doomed 1}, and takes [[/r 4d8[void]]] damage.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["emotion","fear","void"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"giAgkuPfX97KaTZc","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688328719978,"modifiedTime":1691261013632,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Victim's Scorn","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> There are no enemies within the guiltbound's reach.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The dangling corpse scorns those who are too cowardly to save it from its torment, launching a torrent of hate in an @Template[type:line|distance:80], dealing @Damage[8d6[void]] damage (@Check[type:reflex|dc:26|basic:true] save). Creatures that damaged the guiltbound with a melee attack within the last round treat their save result as one degree better than they rolled.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["divine","void"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"FiO4fA3ltY94CKo1","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688328755660,"modifiedTime":1691261013649,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Murder Weapon","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["magical"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"jSTFBS8IJimCSbaE":{"damage":"2d8+10","damageType":"void"}},"bonus":{"value":22},"attackEffects":{"value":["mounting-terror"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"effects":[],"_id":"0py1SCIY3pw0DP2M","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"6.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688328808463,"modifiedTime":1721534893808,"lastModifiedBy":"l2rbNx2a8f5ocpeL","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Dangling Corpse Arm","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["reach-10","sweep"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"fhLdqgYXpkYxkUdX":{"damage":"2d6+10","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":21},"attackEffects":{"v